# was recaptured for having a text search in it is the same trap re-armed one
# line down, so both structural checks are now ast.FunctionDef lookups over the
# same parse the reference sweep already did.
#
# THE FLOOR LINE AND THE CONTROL LINE ARE WHAT KEEP THE TWO ZEROS HONEST. A
# sweep that parsed nothing would report 0 for every name asked of it. So the
